      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Toronto has become the home of so much great Harold, a longform improv format conisting of an opening and 3 beats, all inspired by one audience suggestion.  For the past year, a few of the Harold troupes from Toronto have come together to create a Harold night, an opportunity for us to play and shar"
      }
