        "@value": "Comedy inspired by dating disasters and romantic misfires. Toronto’s sharpest improvisers and comedians turn your best, worst, and most embarrassing dating stories into a night of fast, fearless, laugh-until-it-hurts comedy. Loud, wild, and very funny.  And yes — it’s  also  the perfect night out fo"
