      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Journey to the fantastic, yet familiar, realm of T’Rannah in Toronto’s premier unscripted adventure comedy serial! Audience members will be asked to take up the 20 sided Die of Power and roll to determine the fate of our heroes as they haggle for gear at Forthright Ed’s, storm the gates of Castle Oh"
      }
