        "@value": "A Bad Dog Theatre Company Production  Created by:  Alex Kolanko  Producers:  Stephanie Malek &amp; Alia Rasul   RETURN TO OFFICE Dates: Fridays in March Time: 7pm Location: March 20 at The Rivoli (334 Queen St W), March 27 &amp; April 3 at Comedy Bar Bloor (945 Bloor St. W)    Return to Offi"
