      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "PEOPLE OF THE CITY  February 18 - 28, 2026 in association with Factory Theatre   Step into a Toronto story brought to life, told through improv. People of the City is Bad Dog Theatre’s Armando-style show where real Torontonian stories spark fast, funny, wildly inventive scenes. Each night features a"
