    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "THE FINAL PLAYED OUT OF 2025 - SODA Impro chills out with this cooler of a cast. 1 play, 4 actors... no script  Aurora Browne (Baroness vSS, Run the Burbs) Jessica Young (New Girl, Jimmy Kimmel Live!) Anand Rajaram (Stealing Vows, 2x Dora winner) Oliver Georgiou (Vampire Zombies, The Birds)  And we'"
      }
    ],
