        "@value": "SWEET SWEET ARMANDO FRIENDS    Improv Inspired by Stand Up Comedy  Tonight, a delectable selection of RISING STARS take the Sweet Sweet Wednesday stage once more to bring you an extra helping of laughs!  Our Alumni All-Stars will be joined by special guest stars and Sweet Sweet Friends of Bad Dog!"
      }
    ],
