        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Toronto's Longest Running Improv Show and one of the most popular unscripted comedy formats in the world - where sports meets comedy and the winner is always the audience! Two teams go head to head YOU decide who wins.  Come see the show that helped launch the careers of The Kids In The Hall, Keanu"
