        "@value": "BAD DOG THEATRE PRESENTS     SWEET SWEET ARMANDO FRIENDS:      Improv Inspired by Stand-Up Comedy    Tonight, a delectable selection of RISING STARS take the stage to bring you an extra helping of laughs!   WHAT'S AN ARMANDO?   Armando is a unique long form improv format originated in Chicago, where"
