        "@value": "Hey Toronto! Happy Pride Month cuties! Are you ready for the&nbsp;city’s&nbsp;funniest&nbsp;hottest GAYest improv show?  That’s gonna be a — Hard YAS!  Don’t miss this show for all the gays, theys, and the token straights in your life, featuring a cast full of Toronto’s fave queer improv"
