      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Grassroots #FringeIsFunny movement aims to highlight all of the excellent comedy offerings at this year's Toronto Fringe Festival with over 20 exciting new comedies running at various stages across the city.&nbsp;  Created by a group of independent comedy producers, #FringeIsFunny puts laughter"
