        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Alumni Showcase: Sweet Sweet Armando Friends - Improv Inspired by Stand-Up Comedy   A delectable selection of RISING STARS take the Sweet Sweet Wednesday stage once more to bring you an extra helping of laughs!   WHAT'S AN ARMANDO?   Armando is a unique long form improv format originated in Chicago,"
