      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us at Sweet Action Theatre from 7 pm - 8:30 pm for another gentle gathering of our Sweet Sweet Community.  Put on your cutest florals and spring colours and meet the rest of the Bad Dog community of students, improvisers, and anyone who has visited us at any of our Sweet Sweet Wednesdays!  We'l"
      }
