        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch our talented Bad Dog Academy Studio Series Students do Their Thing!  This hilarious showcase features performances by Alex Tindal's Harold Studio Series Class!  PLUS!  SWEET SWEET FRIENDS  will perform an extra helping of improv bliss!  This week, our Sweet Sweet Friends will try out a format"
