        "@value": "ROSHOMOMMI &amp; WALPURGIS NATCH  Tuesday, March 25, 2025 at 8:00pm The Assembly Theatre (1479 Queen St. West) $15   ROSHOMOMMI   Rashomomi features love, betrayal and mystery! …Or was it Mystery, betrayal and love?? Using the classic trope from Rashomon, flashback memories from each character’s"
