      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The live game show where comedians compete in silly and ridiculous tasks—with a Valentine’s-themed twist!  After sold out shows across the city, the Chorelord (Brandon Hackett) is back and once more wishes to be entertained. The only thing that’ll satisfy his (and your) sick need for amusement is wa"
