        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Maestro: The Improv Comedy Battle-Royale where a dozen improvisers compete in a crash-and-burn elimination-style showdown. There can only be one survivor, and the power to crown the Maestro is YOURS.  Each round, two top-tier directors throw challenge after challenge at our performers, and the audie"
