      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Make Up! The Musical is a musical comedy show that’s completely, well, made up! Using suggestions from the audience, we come up with a whole one hour musical with improvised characters, plots, places, and, of course, music. Starring the award-winning musical improv troupe: Staccayto Staccato!  Stacc"
      }
