        "@value": "Bad Dog Academy Presents    ACADEMY SHOWCASE: SHORT FORM STUDIO + SWEET SWEET FRIENDS   Watch our talented Studio Series Students do Their Thing!   This hilarious showcase features performances by Ryan Sheedy's Short Form Studio Class! PLUS a special helping of laughs with our SWEET SWEET FRIENDS!"
