      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "It’s the holidays and we should all be on the naughty list! A comedy show fuelled with real-life secrets submitted by our audience (anonymously, of course) about all the bad, horrible, and crazy things they’ve done this year!"
      }
