    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "It's a new take on an old classic—a completely improvised retelling of A Christmas Carol—kind of. All proceeds benefit the Parkdale Community Food Bank. Thank God Charles Dickens is dead so he can’t sue us!   Cast:  Carley Thorne, Tyra Banda, Ben Sosa-Wright, Griffin Toplitsky, Lance Oribello, Blair"
      }
