      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Presented by Bad Dog Theatre in Association with Factory Theatre    Yule Log, Egg Nog, Brain Fog… Holiday!      The holidays are here, the gifts are wrapped, the tree’s sparkling, and the fruitcake has found its annual re-gifted home. Now all that’s missing is  the  party—and we’ve got the only one"
      }
    ],
