      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Theatresports: Toronto vs Toronto&nbsp;   TheatreSports: Toronto vs. Toronto - the city's most exhilarating improv comedy battle where neighbourhood pride is at stake and only one neighbourhood can reign supreme!&nbsp;  From the bustling streets of The Annex, to the cutthroat world of the Fi"
