        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "🎪COLONIAL CIRCUS ( @two.2.mango )  Join this fun ride with two clowns who dance, sing and talk gibberish. Colonial Circus takes the subject of colonization head-on, with a sense of wink and play. Bizarre! Very Bizarre! Like Alejandro Jodorwosky Bizarre..but poignant! Comedy Comedy Comedy Ouch! It h"
