      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Narrative Studio + Sketch Studio   ACADEMY SHOWCASE    Watch our talented Studio Series Students do Their Thing!  This hilarious showcase features performances by Nicole Passmore's Narrative Studio 3 and Alessandra Vite's Sketch Studio 2 Classes!    7:00PM | The Assembly Theatre (1479 Queen St."
