        "@value": "Be the builder of worlds, the Alpha and Omega  Put your name in the bucket and build an entire universe in one show! Anyone who shows up gets to play a part (if they so choose). Improvise in scenes that will be intertwined and threaded together by the host into a world of hilarity, heartbreak, tange"
