        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog Academy's Most Advanced Classes Experiment, Test Formats, and PLAY! Our Studio Series students work together for 6 months to generate original formats while working on specific approaches to improv and sketch.   Wednesday June 19th | Sweet Action Theatre (180 Shaw St. #106) |"
      }
