      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bad Dog Academy Thematic Studio Series Grad Class Presents...   Broken Record    Play That One Again!   Where your favourite song will be turned into a scene on repeat... on repeat... on repeat...   Created and Performed by:   Alec Jacobson Alex Kamp Arden Church Carol Ruiz Lindsey Middleton Luke Ce"
