        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Join us for a Sweet Sweet Wednesday at @sweetactiontheatre with Maestro Impro!  Long-time Maestro darling Gavin Williams joins one of Bad Dog Theatre’s top-tier improvisers to direct 12 performers in a crash-and-burn improv showdown. The directors inspire the players, and the audience scores each sc"
