      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "TASK FORCE + WAR!!!!... IN SPACE   Thursday, March 28, 2024 at 9:30pm The Assembly Theatre (1479 Queen St. West) $15 online | $20 at the door   Task Force:   This show is a thrilling throwback to the action adventures that once ruled Saturday mornings. Like Voltron or Power Rangers, we feature"
