        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "THE SEX-T-REX HOUR   Wednesday, March 27, 2024 at 11pm The Assembly Theatre (1479 Queen St. West)  Sex T-Rex Comedy is a Toronto-based comedy troupe whose cinematic style, wild physicality and spot-on parody has delighted audiences since 2008. They have garnered rave reviews and accolades for their"
