      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch our Talented Bad Dog Academy Graduates do Their Thing!  This hilarious showcase features improv performances by Anders Yates' Foundation 4 and Ken Hall's Clownprov 1 Graduating Classes!  Stick around for BIG FRIENDLY SCENE, our PWYC all-play improv jam, at 8:30pm!"
      }
