      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Come see some of Canada’s best improvisers competing for the glory of their hometowns. BEER LEAGUE is an improv competition that blends improv styles from across the country with our national pastimes: hockey and drinking about hockey. Featuring talent seen on CBC, Hulu, SyFy, FX, CTV, Netflix, and"
