      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog’s performance-level students strut their stuff on stage!  Our Studio Series classes work together for 6 months to generate original improvised formats while working on specific approaches to improv.  F eaturing Ryan Sheedy's SHORT FORM STUDIO &amp; Alex Tindal's HAROLD STUDIO!   Ac"
