        "@value": "Live action comic book reading series!  This month of COMIC BOOKS LIVE!!! Assembly Theatre joins forces with Bad Dog Theatre to pluck a comic book from all eras of graphic fiction history, chosen by series host, Assembly alumni and all-around comic fanboy LUIS FERNANDES (Therac 25, The Assembly Thea"
