    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Most Wonderful Time Of The Year (For Everyone Else)  Daniel was born December 24. Dan was born December 26. Both feel robbed. So they wrote a show about it.  Come celebrate with Dan Curtis Thompson (Just For Laughs, Absolute Comedy) and Daniel Williston (Soulpepper, Mirvish) in a cabaret of song"
      }
    ],
