      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The after-work social function: Where angels go to die  Every improvisor brings an actual real dish of their own creation as CEO and President Mr. Robinson hosts this year’s mandatory holiday potluck! Bear witness to an after-work social function where petty grudges, mild crushes, and nakedly opport"
