        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog Academy’s performance-level students strut their stuff on stage this month at Sweet Action Theatre! Our Studio Series classes work together for 6 months to generate original improvised formats while working on specific approaches to improv.  Featuring:     Thematic Studio - Instructor:"
