      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "They Go Low, We Go Laugh is a variety show where folx of colour and marginalized identities will do stand-up, storytelling, improv, sketch comedy &amp; more! - all in the name of shining more light in this world, especially during hard times. We invite all to celebrate our voices with us.  This"
      }
