      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Get ready to be transported to the Golden Age of Piracy with Our Flag Means [Blank] - an unscripted Pirate Adventure, brought to you by the award-winning Bad Dog Theatre Company.  Fans of Our Flag Means Death and the uninitiated alike will love Our Flag Means [Blank], a hilarious and unscripted inte"
