      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Who will take the crown?  M﻿aestro Impro™ is often described as a 'crash-and-burn-elimination-style' format. Two directors are there to inspire the players, the audience scores each scene. As the evening progresses, players are eliminated, until only one 'Maestro' improviser remains.  W﻿ith your tic"
