        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog students do their thing! This hilarious showcase features improvised performances by Anders Yates’ Thematic Longform Studio &amp; Daphney Joseph’s Longform 1 Class!    STUDIO SERIES SHOWCASE Date: Tuesday, May 2 Time: 8:00pm  Location: Comedy Bar Danforth (2800 Danforth Ave) Admiss"
