      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Women of Colour (&amp; Friends!) express their comedic voices in new and vibrant ways!   They Go Low, We Go Laugh  is a variety show where folx of colour and marginalized identities may do stand-up, improv, storytelling, solo sketch, a poem, a monologue, a song, you name it! - all in the name of"
