        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog’s performance-level students strut their stuff on stage! Our Harold, Thematic Longform, and Narrative Longform classes work together for 6 months to generate original improvised formats while working on specific approaches to improv.    STUDIO SERIES SHOWCASE Date: April 19, 2023 Time:"
