        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Watch Bad Dog’s Term 1 Students strut their stuff on stage! You can even catch our amazing Faculty onstage for a set!  Classes Showcasing:    IMPROV - FOUNDATION 4 (2)    SHORTFORM 3    LONGFORM 2    and a Faculty Set!     THERE’S NO CASE LIKE SHOWCASE: TERM 1 CLASS SHOWCASE Date: February 27, 2023"
