        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Check out our bi-weekly drop-in show!  Bad Dog Theatre is thrilled to partner with Sweet Action Theatre to bring you THE BUCKET SHOW. All are welcome to come by for a chance to perform improv live on-stage (or watch the unscripted hilarity as an audience member).    THE BUCKET SHOW Date: Wednesdays,"
      }
