      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Bad Dog's flagship show, THEATRESPORTS, has been making Toronto audiences laugh for over 40 years. THEATRESPORTS mixes the thrill of improv with the energy of a sporting event, putting you in the middle of the side-splitting scenes.  We are celebrating 40 years of THEATRESPORTS in Toronto by bringin"
      }
